    "description": "For each official context, resample that context's own real non-targeting control cells and label the resulting cells with the requested perturbations. No model, no training, no predicted effect. It exists to exercise the generation, validation and packaging path end to end on real counts, and to give every later trial a reference whose dispersion is exactly right because it is real data.",
