      "raw/controls/context_C.h5ad"
    ],
    "rules": [
      "Resampling is WITHIN context: a cell labelled context A comes from context A.",
      "Cells are drawn without replacement within a perturbation (400 distinct cells out of 18,400) and with replacement across perturbations.",
      "Source-cell provenance is written to a diagnostics sidecar, never into the submitted matrix."
    ],
    "not_this": [
      "This is NOT the official score-zero baseline. The official 0 point is the cell-context mean computed by the scorer against held-out data; this is a resample of the released control cells and its score is unknown.",
